# Route: guide 14 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 34 to
# 36, 21 quests, 1.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dustwallow Marsh, Stonetalon Mountains, Mulgore): Brackenwall Village
# -> The Quagmire -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill -> Theramore Isle ->
# Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill ->
# Brackenwall Village -> Sun Rock Retreat -> Windshear Crag -> Grimtotem Post
# -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 6607 Nat Pagle,
# Angler Extreme.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Tiara of the Deep (2846), Leaders of the Fang (914), A
# Vengeful Fate (1102), Searching for the Lost Satchel (5722), Testing an
# Enemy's Strength (5723).

